# v1.19.0 (S22.1) Search across all notes: the Find bar's All notes scope,
# the results list in place of the page, a row opens the note at its line,
# Back returns to the list (Forma 1440x1920).
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/lamps.md
open-fixture tests/emu/fixtures/markdown-tour.md
tap-on Files
tap-on New note
clear-field
type dusk
tap-on OK
type Notes from the bridge at dusk, more lamps and a lamp by the gate.
tap-on Find
expect-mode find
expect-find Find
shot v1.19-search-this-note
# All notes: an empty query invites typing.
tap-on All notes
expect-mode find
shot v1.19-search-empty
type lamp
shot v1.19-search-list
# A row opens its note in write mode at that line; the bar closes.
tap-on Result:0
expect-mode write
expect-open dusk.md
shot v1.19-search-opened
# Back brings the list back with the same query and page.
tap-on Back
expect-mode find
expect-open dusk.md
shot v1.19-search-back
# The page buttons and the ‹ › arrows page the list.
page
shot v1.19-search-page-2
tap-on SearchNext
tap-on SearchPrev
page back
# Aa narrows the search; a longer query too.
tap-on Aa
shot v1.19-search-case
tap-on Aa
type s on
shot v1.19-search-narrowed
# Enter opens the first result; Back again.
usb-key Enter
expect-mode write
expect-open lamps.md
tap-on Back
expect-mode find
# This note again: the page returns, counted as before (dusk.md has no
# "lamps on").
tap-on This note
expect-mode find
expect-find None
tap-on All notes
# Esc closes the bar and the list.
esc
expect-mode write
# Night, landscape.
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/On
tap-on Close
tap-on Find
tap-on All notes
type lamp
shot v1.19-search-night
tap-on FindClose
tap-on Options
tap-on Dark mode/Off
tap-on Orientation/Landscape
tap-on Close
expect-screen 1920x1440
tap-on Find
tap-on All notes
type lamp
# Landscape leaves no room for rows under the bar with the keyboard up:
# Keys hides it and the list fills the page.
tap-on Keys
shot v1.19-search-landscape
tap-on Keys
tap-on FindClose
tap-on Options
tap-on Orientation/Portrait
tap-on Close
expect-status saved
